    ],
    "lines": [
      "The essay follows the freedom to control the pace, disagree with a stable voice, and stop.",
      "A summary may preserve events while losing the experience of discovering you trusted the wrong person.",
      "Reading becomes a meeting with a perspective that need not rearrange itself to please you."
    ],
    "chapter": "A perspective that stays put",
    "lens": "content",
